 "description": "<p>A Japanese kimono set in polyester: the robe and a matching thong, as pictured, one size for 40-60 kg. The magnolia pattern is the print, and it is the only decoration the garment needs.</p>\n<p>Two pieces, with the robe doing the dressing and the thong doing the rest. The kimono cut wraps and ties at the waist, which adjusts across the whole one-size range without tailoring.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: kimono, thong</li>\n<li>Style: Japanese</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The simplest kimono option in the category, and the print carries it.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Magnolia-print Japanese kimono with matching thong, one size for 40-60 kg, polyester wrap robe.</p>\n",
